  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Equitable Lesotho-Support to the National Statistic System in Lesotho</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The programme Support to the National Statistical System (NSS) in Lesotho is part of the action &#xbf;Equitable Lesotho&#xbf;, adopted in 2022. The main objective of the programme is to increase the use of gender-sensitive quality data and statistics by the government and the international partners in policies and programmes&#xbf; design.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;In the absence of up-to-date legal frameworks and coordination mechanisms inside the NSS, the programme will provide support to legal reviews and the establishment of a coordination mechanism. Further, the programme focuses on the mainstreaming of gender and disability in the development of all data and statistics developed in the NSS in Lesotho.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The outputs are:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xb7; Increased evidence to inform the revision of the National Statistic System&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xb7; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Improved national capacities to monitor the national development programmes and the SDG agenda&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Improved capacities for protection and gender mainstreaming and disability inclusion in data collection, analysis and dissemination.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The proposed activities would be implemented nation-wide in Lesotho.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
